EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
LegalLens AI is set to disrupt the LegalTech / AI SaaS landscape in India by delivering a unique, state-of-the-art solution for LegalLens AI is an AI-powered legal intelligence platform that helps small law firms and businesses analyze contracts, identify legal risks, generate compliance reports, and automate legal document review.

The platform uses AI agents to detect problematic clauses, compare agreements against industry standards, recommend revisions, and generate legal summaries in plain language.

Revenue is generated through monthly subscriptions, enterprise licensing, and legal compliance services.

The goal is to make high-quality legal assistance affordable and accessible for startups and small businesses.. By focusing specifically on Small law firms, legal consultants, startups, and freelancers and utilizing advanced automated venture-building capabilities, LegalLens AI achieves unprecedented efficiency and cost savings, maximizing return on the initial $3,614 budget allocation.

